#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-kapplication; is a desktop client for Rocket.Chat servers. It lets you "
"chat in channels, private groups, discussions and teams, exchange direct "
"messages, share files, and administer a server, all from a native &kde; "
"application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-kapplication; can be connected to several Rocket.Chat servers at the "
"same time and lets you switch between them quickly."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a Server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &i18n-kapplication; is started for the first time, you are asked to add "
"a server account. You can add other accounts later with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add Server…</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. Enter the server &URL; and choose an authentication method."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on what the server allows, the following authentication methods "
"are available:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "User name (or email) and password"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Personal access token"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "OAuth providers such as Google, GitHub, GitLab, Facebook or Twitter"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If two-factor authentication is enabled on your account, &i18n-kapplication; "
"asks for the code when you log in. Passwords are stored in the system wallet."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the server allows it, you can create a new account with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Register a New User…</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Several Servers"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each configured account appears as a tab. Use <menuchoice><guimenu>Window</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Next Server</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Window</guimenu><guimenuitem>Previous Server</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to switch between them. Accounts can be enabled, "
"disabled, reordered or removed in the <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel> page of "
"the settings dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Export Accounts</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> and <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Import Accounts</guimenuitem></menuchoice> let you move "
"your account configuration to another computer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Main Window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Room List"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left side of the window lists your channels, private groups, direct "
"messages, discussions and teams. A search field at the top filters the list. "
"Your status (online, busy, away, offline, or a custom status) can be changed "
"from the status bar at the bottom of the window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu changes how the list looks:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Condensed</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem> or "
"<guimenuitem>Extended</guimenuitem> display"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sorting <guimenuitem>By Last Message</guimenuitem> or "
"<guimenuitem>Alphabetically</guimenuitem>, with optional <guimenuitem>Unread "
"on Top</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Show Room Avatar</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Show Favorite "
"Room</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mark All Channels as Read"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Channel</guimenu><guimenuitem>Jump to Next Unread "
"Channel</guimenuitem></menuchoice> takes you to the next room with unread "
"messages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Room View"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The right side of the window shows the messages of the selected room. The "
"header displays the room name and topic, and contains buttons to mark the "
"room as favorite, open the room information, list its users, search "
"messages, start a call, and open the room menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "The room menu gives access to:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pinned, starred and mentioned messages, threads, discussions and file "
"attachments"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding or inviting users, showing banned users"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notification settings for this room"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic translation of messages"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting or pruning messages (with the required permissions)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "End-to-end encryption, when the server supports it"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Messages"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing Messages"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type your message in the text field at the bottom of the room and press "
"&Enter; to send it. Messages support Markdown formatting. Typing <literal>@</"
"literal> completes user names, <literal>#</literal> completes channel names, "
"<literal>:</literal> completes emoji and <literal>/</literal> lists the "
"slash commands available on the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "The buttons next to the text field let you:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert an emoji, including the custom emoji of the server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Attach one or more files (you can also drag and drop or paste them)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Record and send a sound message or a video message"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the tools provided by plugins, such as taking a screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Spell checking and auto-correction are available while typing and can be "
"configured in the settings dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acting on Messages"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hovering a message shows buttons to add a reaction, reply in a thread or "
"star the message. Its context menu offers more actions, depending on your "
"permissions:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit, delete or quote the message"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy the message, the selection, or a link to the message"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reply in a thread, follow or unfollow it, show the full thread"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start a discussion or a private conversation from the message"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pin, star, forward or report the message"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mark the message as unread"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translate the message, or show the original text"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show read receipts, when enabled on the server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Images, videos and sounds are displayed inline and can be opened in a "
"viewer. &URL; previews can be enabled in the settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the search button of the room header to search the messages of the "
"current room. <menuchoice><guimenu>Channel</guimenu><guimenuitem>Join Room…</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, <guimenuitem>Join Team…</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>Open Private Conversation…</guimenuitem> search the server "
"directory for rooms, teams and users."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rooms, Discussions and Teams"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Channel</guimenu> menu lets you create:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Create New Channel…</guimenuitem>: a public channel or a "
"private group, optionally read-only, broadcast or encrypted"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Create Direct Messages…</guimenuitem>: a conversation with one "
"or more users"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Create Discussion…</guimenuitem>: a sub-conversation attached "
"to a room"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Create Team…</guimenuitem>: a group of users with its own "
"channels"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The room information dialog shows the name, topic, announcement, description "
"and avatar of the room. Owners can edit them, change the room type, set a "
"password, and configure options such as read-only mode or message pruning. "
"Team owners can add, remove and convert team channels."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-kapplication; uses the desktop notification system to tell you about "
"new messages and mentions, and shows unread counters in the room list and in "
"the system tray. Notification behavior (desktop alert, sound, email) can be "
"set for each room with <guimenuitem>Configure Notification…</guimenuitem> in "
"the room menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Notify History</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> lists the notifications you received during the "
"session."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "End-to-End Encryption"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the server enables it, &i18n-kapplication; supports Rocket.Chat end-to-"
"end encryption for direct messages and private groups. Your encryption keys "
"are protected by a password that you can manage in the <guilabel>Encryption</"
"guilabel> page of <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>My Account…"
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Encrypted rooms show a lock icon in their "
"header. Note that the content of encrypted messages cannot be searched."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "My Account"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>My Account…</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> lets you manage your Rocket.Chat profile:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Profile: name, user name, email, avatar, status message and password"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preferences offered by the server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two-factor authentication (email or TOTP)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "End-to-end encryption keys"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Personal access tokens"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "Devices logged in to your account"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Feature previews"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Server Administration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Users with the required permissions can administer the server from "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Administration</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Administrator…</guimenuitem> gives access to server "
"information, rooms, users, invites, custom emoji, custom sounds, custom user "
"statuses, roles, permissions, OAuth applications, the moderation console and "
"the server logs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Server Settings…</guimenuitem> lets you change the server "
"configuration, and the <guimenuitem>Applications</guimenuitem> entries let "
"you browse and manage Rocket.Chat Marketplace applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Server Checklist…</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> checks the server configuration for common "
"problems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid "Offline Mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&i18n-kapplication; can keep messages in a local database (enable "
"<guilabel>Enable local database</guilabel> in the <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> settings), so that rooms are displayed faster and remain readable "
"when the connection is lost. <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Work Offline</guimenuitem></menuchoice> disconnects "
"from the server on purpose."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &i18n-kapplication;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &i18n-"
"kapplication;…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> opens the settings dialog, which "
"contains the following pages:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add, modify, enable, disable or remove server accounts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"System tray icon, status on startup, image and &URL; previews, animated "
"GIFs, local database, logging, and other behavior options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Font used to display messages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Spell Checking</guilabel> and <guilabel>Auto-Correction</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language and correction rules used while typing."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translation engine used to translate messages."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text-to-speech and speech-to-text options, when available."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable or disable plugins, for example sharing text, web shortcuts, "
"screenshots, or text generation with an AI engine."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Feedback"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose which anonymous usage statistics are sent to the developers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The color scheme can be changed in the <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu, and "
"the message font size in the <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tools"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu provides helpers mostly useful for "
"troubleshooting:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Show Channel Log</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Show Server "
"Errors</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Show RocketChat Information</guimenuitem>: version and "
"capabilities of the server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Retry Wallet Access</guimenuitem>, when the password could not "
"be read from the wallet"
msgstr ""

